@startuml
scale 1.0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
autonumber

title Bieu do trinh tu cho ca su dung Tao don sua chua

actor Customer
participant CreateOrder
participant Storage
participant Firestore

Customer -> CreateOrder : Mo man hinh va nhap thong tin
CreateOrder -> Firestore : Lay danh sach tau / xuong
Firestore --> CreateOrder : Du lieu hien thi
Customer -> CreateOrder : Chon anh va nhan Tao don
CreateOrder -> Storage : Tai anh len
Storage --> CreateOrder : URL anh
CreateOrder -> Firestore : Luu tau neu can
Firestore --> CreateOrder : shipId
CreateOrder -> Firestore : Tao repairOrder
Firestore --> CreateOrder : Thanh cong
CreateOrder --> Customer : Thong bao thanh cong

@enduml
